# The pin of the antigravity-cli AgentHarness (docs/adr/0050 §2): one
# release of Antigravity CLI, by version and by the sha256 of each Linux
# tarball. The Containerfile downloads the one for the build's architecture
# at image build and refuses it unless the digest matches; nothing else
# ever fetches it, and no image or artefact that holds it is published (the
# binary is proprietary, docs/adr/0050 §6).
#
# Digests: the ones GitHub publishes for the release's assets
# (gh api repos/google-antigravity/antigravity-cli/releases/tags/1.5.1,
# read 2026-11-06); the x64 one was also checked by sha256sum -c on the
# downloaded tarball in the spike runs of 2026-11-05 and 2026-11-06.
# 1.5.1 is the version the spike verified, not the latest (1.5.2 was out
# on 2026-11-06): a bump is its own commit with ./go harness-conformance
# as its eval (docs/adr/0018).
VERSION=1.5.1
URL_AMD64=https://github.com/google-antigravity/antigravity-cli/releases/download/1.5.1/agy_cli_linux_x64.tar.gz
SHA256_AMD64=2a64ccfc5f6679c253769f0760614af5de04d8dc1eeeec9b9752ba4c8dd92250
URL_ARM64=https://github.com/google-antigravity/antigravity-cli/releases/download/1.5.1/agy_cli_linux_arm64.tar.gz
SHA256_ARM64=c43a50831006d95a7637aa9cad7000fda9b9bb4b3ece8c53cc6c5089b92542ea
